@startuml Reveal
!include ../../style.puml
!include ./RSAPrivateKey.puml

title Reveal Struct

class Reveal <<struct>> {
    + requestId: string
    + answer: bytes
    + rsaPrivateKey: RSAPrivateKey
}

Reveal --> RSAPrivateKey : contains

note right of Reveal
  **Reveal Struct**
  
  Contains the solution to timelock
  puzzle: answer value and RSA
  private key for verification.
end note

note bottom of Reveal
  **Timelock Solution**
  
  Answer is the puzzle output.
  RSA private key (P,Q) proves
  legitimate puzzle generation.
end note

@enduml